        time.sleep(0.5)

    uart_worker.stop()

Architecture Details
 * Thread Isolation: Serial I/O blocking (write() / read() timeouts) runs entirely inside RS485SerialWorker, ensuring primary sensor ingestion loops never drop packets.
 * Hardware RTS Management: Automatically configures pyserial.rs485.RS485Settings to toggle direction control pins (DE/RE) on RS-485 transceiver boards.
 * Fault Tolerance: Gracefully degrades to a dry-run logging mode if the designated hardware serial port (/dev/ttyUSB0 or COM3) is absent or busy.
